      <h4><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.UI.Screens.GamePlayScreen.html">GamePlayScreen</a></h4>
      <section><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.UI.Screens.GamePlayScreen.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Main gameplay screen with HUD elements and debug information display
Provides access to game state information and gameplay controls
Uses TimeService for accurate playtime display with proper pause handling</p>
</section>
      <h4><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.UI.Screens.LoadGamePopup.html">LoadGamePopup</a></h4>
      <section><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.UI.Screens.LoadGamePopup.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Load game popup that extends the base save file list functionality
Provides double-click loading and load button functionality</p>
</section>
      <h4><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.UI.Screens.LoadingScreen.html">LoadingScreen</a></h4>
